{"id":"word:hebrew:H6041","type":"word","title":"עָנִי","subtitle":"H6041 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"depressed , in mind or circumstances","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עָנִי (H6041) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 79 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עָנִי (ʻânîy) means depressed , in mind or circumstances First listed occurrence: 2Sam 22 28."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עָנִי","transliteration":"ʻânîy","pronunciation":"aw-nee'","strong":"H6041","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6041","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["עָנִ֣י","עָנִ֖י","עָנִ֥י","עניים","עָנִי֙"],"morphs":[["HAamsa",38],["HAampa",11],["HAampc",6],["HRd/Aamsa",5],["HC/Aamsa",5],["HAafsa",3],["HTd/Aamsa",2],["HR/Aamsa",2],["HR/Aamsc/Sp2ms",1],["HTd/Aampa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"depressed , in mind or circumstances","usage":"afflicted, humble, lowly, needy, poor.","full":"H6041. ani עָנִי adj poor, afflicted, humble ; — ׳ע Deut 24:12 51t.; plural עֲיִּים Isa 3:15 6 t.; construct עֲנִיֵּי 10:2 4 t. (see also Kt and Qr below עָנָו above); suffix עֲנִיֶּיךָ Psa 72:2 ; 74:19 , עֲנִיֶּ֑ךָ Deut 15:11 , עֲנִיָּו Isa 49:13 ; feminine singular עֲנִיָּה 51:21 ; 54:11 ( + 10:30 ᵑ0 , but read עֲנִיהָ , see I. ענה ); — 1 poor, needy , || אביון Deut 15:11 ; 24:14 . 15 Prov 31:20 , || יתום Job 24:9 ; Exod 22:24 (E), Deut 24:12 ; having right to gleanings Lev 19:10 ; 23:22 (H); ע ׳יְמֵי Prov 15:15 , compare 14:21 (Kt). 2 poor and weak , oppressed by the rich and powerful Isa 3:14-15 , 32:7 (Qr), 58:7 ; 29:12 ; 36:6 , 15 ; Prov 30:14 ; Eccl 6:8 ; Ezek 18:17 ; Zech 7:10 ; Job 24:4 , also Amos 8:4 (Qr); || דל Job 34:28 ; Prov 22:22 ; עַמִּי עֲנִיֵּי Isa 10:2 ; ואביוך עני Job 24:14 Prov 31:9 Jer 22:16 ; Ezek 16:49 ; 18:12 ; 22:29 . 3 poor, weak, afflicted Israel, or pious in Israel afflicted by wicked nations or the wicked in Israel itself Psa 10:2 ; 10:9 (twice in verse); 14:6 (dubious, compare 53:6 ) 102:1 (or proper name), Isa 14:32 ; Hab 3:14 ; of Zion, עֲנִיָּה Isa 51:21 ; 54:11 ; ע ׳שׁד Psa 12:6 ; וע ׳יחיד 25:16 ; ואביון עני 35:10 ; 37:14 ; Psalm 40:18 = Psalm 70:6; 74:21 ; 86:1 ; 109:16 ; 109:22 , plural Isa 41:17 ; וְכוֺאֵב עני Psa 69:30 ; ׳ע וָרָשׁ 82:3 ; ע ׳עֱנוּת 22:25 ; ׳ע וְגֹוֵעַ 88:16 ; || דל Isa 26:6 ; Zeph 3:12 ; ׳ע וּנְכֵהרֿוּחַ Isa 66:2 ; &#8212; Zech 11:7 , 11 see II. כְּנַעֲנִי ; — God does not forget them Psa 9:13 (Kt); 9:19 (Qr); 10:12 (Kt) 74:19 , but has compassion on them Isa 49:13 , saves Psa 34:7 , delivers 35:10 , and bestows various favours 68:11 ; 140:13 , the king also judges 72:2 ; 72:4 , and delivers 72:12 . 4 humble, lowly , Zech 9:9 (victorious king); opposed to לֵצִים Prov 3:34 (Kt); opposed to גֵּאִים 16:19 (Kt); עני עם opposed to עינים רמות Psa 18:28 = 2Sam 22:28 .","rootNote":"from 6031 ; (practically the same as 6035 , although the margin constantly disputes this, making 6035 subjective and objective);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Sam 22 28","keyReferences":["2Sam 22 28","Amos 8 4","Deut 15 11","Deut 24 12","Deut 24 14","Deut 24 15","Eccl 6 8","Exod 22 24"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":79,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Sam 22 28","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Amos 8 4","book":"Amos","chapter":8,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲנִיֵּי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"Deut 15 11","book":"Deut","chapter":15,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/עֲנִיֶּ֛/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Aamsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 24 12","book":"Deut","chapter":24,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Deut 24 14","book":"Deut","chapter":24,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנִ֣י